    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak1.webp",
      "alt": "amimak1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...and that’s how you find slope-intercept form. Any questions?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...could you please repeat...all of that?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak2.webp",
      "alt": "amimak2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, I have no idea what else I’m supposed to do. She’s just not retaining any information.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak3.webp",
      "alt": "amimak3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s just because you keep using big words and weird terms like ‘slope intercept form.’ Who the heck even knows what that is?!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak4.webp",
      "alt": "amimak4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everyone! Or at least we’re supposed to!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "mak \"The next mandatory test is based almost entirely around this and, if you can’t even remember what it’s",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "called, there is no way you’re going to pass.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak5.webp",
      "alt": "amimak5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahhhh! Why can’t all of our tests just be about how to be a good caretaker?!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you can’t even figure out slope intercept form, there’s no way you’re a good caretaker.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak4.webp",
      "alt": "amimak4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Those two things have absolutely nothing in common!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And besides, I’m a much better caretaker than you’ll ever be, Makoto!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Take that back!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I bet you’re probably wondering how I ended up in this position.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, to be honest, I am too.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It all started with Ami coming up to me in class and asking for help with algebra.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"I guess a boring thing like that must have caused Makoto’s geek-radar",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "to go off because she immediately jumped up and volunteered to help coach Ami on the subject.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course, Ami wanted me around as well, so...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Here we are. ‘Learning’ things.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You two really don’t get along, do you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak6.webp",
      "alt": "amimak6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Makoto is just jealous because you spend more time with me than her.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak7.webp",
      "alt": "amimak7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-I am not! I’m just trying to help you so you don’t get held back!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? She’s yelling at me to try and impress you but you’re not impressed at all, are you Sensei?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...wait...what’s going on, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak8.webp",
      "alt": "amimak8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Tell her to focus or she’s never going to get into a good[school] and become a doctor.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak9.webp",
      "alt": "amimak9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t wanna be a doctor! I wanna be a housewife!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak10.webp",
      "alt": "amimak10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who in their right mind would marry someone who doesn’t even know slope intercept form?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": None of your business!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I bet Sensei doesn’t even know the formula for that!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Please don’t drag me into this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Preposterous! Of course he does!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No way! He doesn’t like boring stuff like that!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not boring just because it’s educational!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak11.webp",
      "alt": "amimak11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! What is the formula for slope intercept form?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "m = bx + y",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Definitely ‘m = bx + y.’",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak12.webp",
      "alt": "amimak12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tch-!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Teehee~ Told you he doesn’t know!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei isn’t interested in that kind of stuff!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s simply not true! Of course he’s interested in that kind of stuff. He just had...a momentary memory lapse.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Things like that happen.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whatever you say, Makoto~",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "y = mx + b",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Easy. ‘y = mx + b.’",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak13.webp",
      "alt": "amimak13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I expected nothing less from you, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you know the answer to that?!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, I might not be the best at showing it...or applying it...but I’m actually pretty smart.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m offended you’d think otherwise, Ami.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it’s any consolation, I’ve never judged you at all. I think you’re brilliant and wonderful and the best man I’ve ever met.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak14.webp",
      "alt": "amimak14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "a \"Hey! You watch it! I’m supposed to be the primary love interest",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "and I’m not gonna let some smartypants glasses-wearer get in the way of that!\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak10.webp",
      "alt": "amimak10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who are you calling a smartypants glasses-wearer?!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one who is a smartypants and is also wearing glasses!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"The two of them continue shouting at each other for another several minutes",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "before I finally decide to step in...\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "x = by + m",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Definitely ‘x = by + m.’",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak12.webp",
      "alt": "amimak12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tch-!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Teehee~ Told you he doesn’t know!",
      "spk": "Ami",
