    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei isn’t interested in that kind of stuff!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s simply not true! Of course he’s interested in that kind of stuff. He just had...a momentary memory lapse.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Things like that happen.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whatever you say, Makoto~",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak15.webp",
      "alt": "amimak15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Listen, you two. It doesn’t matter whether or not I know this formula. What matters is that both of you do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d hate to see something as simple as this hold either of you back.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I’d also hate to get in trouble for having some of my students fail the standardized test.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thank god that Makoto is able to tutor everyone on things that I can’t remember or never learned in the first place.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well said, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, obviously you don’t have to worry about me. But those words are very wise when applied to everyone else.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak16.webp",
      "alt": "amimak16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can't you just study with me instead, Sensei? Makoto is a mean teacher.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak17.webp",
      "alt": "amimak17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry, Ami...I just get frustrated whenever it seems like someone isn’t paying attention.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...you’re not gonna be a big meanie anymore?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...will do my best to not be a ‘big meanie...’",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Fine. I guess I can try a little harder, too.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, can we finally move on with things?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you do one more thing for me, first?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course. What do you need?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you admit that Sensei likes cute girls like me more than he likes nerdy ones like you?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak18.webp",
      "alt": "amimak18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, don’t look at me. I can’t control her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s your [niece]. Can’t you at least tell her to focus?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...I can try?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami, focus.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene amimak19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/amimak19.webp",
      "alt": "amimak19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, Sensei!~",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
